        {
          "id": "webassembly-测试文稿--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "e2e/exec-wasi.spec.ts 的测试文稿：C 程序在浏览器中（网页与幻灯片）运行于 WebAssembly（WASI），编译时用同一份二进制录制输出。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "c-program--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "c-program--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-program--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "浏览器中的 clang 编译这段程序，再运行编译出的 WASI 程序；编译时在 Node 中用同一份二进制录制它的输出。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "c-program--sum": {
      "id": "c-program--sum",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "c",
      "value": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n  int sum = 0;\n  for (int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) sum += i;\n  printf(\"1 + 2 + ... + 100 = %d\\n\", sum);\n  return 0;\n}",
      "execution": {
        "when": "both"
      }
    }
  },
